cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "PaySQL: Open-source PL/SQL payroll & salary-management platform"
message: "If you use PaySQL in your work, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "PaySQL contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/nowshad7/SalaryManagementSystem"
abstract: >-
  PaySQL is an open-source, modular, REST-ready payroll and salary-management platform built on
  Oracle PL/SQL, with a REST API exposed via Oracle REST Data Services (ORDS). It manages
  employees, component-based compensation, leave, tax and statutory deductions, and full pay-run
  cycles.
keywords:
  - payroll
  - plsql
  - oracle
  - salary-management
  - hr
  - ords
  - open-source-payroll
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-09
